    41→    """Semantic Version data class following SemVer 2.0.0 spec.
    42→
    43→    Supports format: MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH[-prerelease][+build]
    44→
    45→    Attributes:
    46→        major: Major version number (incompatible API changes)
    47→        minor: Minor version number (backward-compatible functionality)
    48→        patch: Patch version number (backward-compatible bug fixes)
    49→        prerelease: Optional prerelease identifier (e.g., "alpha", "beta.1")
    50→        build: Optional build metadata (e.g., "20240101", "sha.5114f85")
    51→    """
    52→
